    target: {fileID: 0}
    qty: 30
  offerLine: I've minded this place long enough, and my own tree's a mess. You don't need an old owl hanging about. Come and say goodbye.
  activeLine: Come on, then. Say it. I won't cry.
  readyLine: I'll still drop in, some nights. I've got recipes I'd sell to the right gecko, at the right price. Oh, and word gets around. I may have told someone you're back.
  doneLine: Well? Off you go. Someone might be coming.
